Z||000033||Oreif||11-27-2001||12:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Anything hanging from the mirror hinders visibility and is a distraction and looks stupid in my opinion, so I have nothing.  Figures you'd have earnhardt stuff kyle.  Did you know Jeff Gordon is likely going to break every earnhardt record before he retires?  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Agree that it hinders view and is a distraction. <P>Jeff Gordon cannot "break every record before he retires"<P>Earnhart has the record of the most "after race" crashes. (3)<P>Gordon doesn't have the "attitude" to accomplish that.<P>Earnhart has the record of the most people to visit his business in memory of his death.<P>In order for Gordon to beat that he can't "retire".<P>The "Man in Black" will always be more popular than Gordon. Gordon is like all the others before him. He is liked by many now but his fame will fade. You can't compete with a legend.<P>||||reg||1
